#THANKS FOR PLAYING!#Conclusion



Entering the mind of Simon was not an easy

undertaking to start with, wading through

the arcane creations that his book had

summoned was a nightmare I will never be able

to grasp. But I made it, I managed to

destroy his creations and their passage; 

the book.

suicide
{
	line1		"Tap * to resist the suicidal influence!"
	nobutton	"attack button"
	cfgbutton	"+attack"
}

sprint
{
	line1		"Hold * to sprint. The blue bar on the HUD is your stamina bar."
	line2		"Sprinting will deplete your stamina bar quickly, so use it sparingly."
	line3		"Your stamina will slowly recover while not sprinting or jumping. Crouching recovers faster."
	nobutton	"sprint button"
	cfgbutton	"+sprint"
}

nightvision
{
	line1		"Press * to turn nightvision on/off."
